WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
Crouching light punch whiffs during Ryu’s wake-up.

2
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.150
Standing medium punch counter-hits Ryu at the corner.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.700
Crouching medium punch connects after the counter hit.

4
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.250
Medium Swagger Step hits after the link.

5
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.350
The forward-punch follow-up continues the juggle.
